cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "IW-FusionFM: Ocean Internal Wave Detection from Sentinel-1 SAR and SWOT"
message: >-
  If you use this software or the accompanying event database,
  please cite it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "IW-FusionFM Team (anonymous, for double-blind review)"
doi: 10.17632/jfxrd9sn93
url: "https://github.com/jackie587/iw-fusionfm"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  IW-FusionFM is a research pipeline for detecting oceanic internal
  solitary waves in Sentinel-1 IW GRD SAR imagery with SWOT KaRIn
  sea-surface height as an auxiliary modality. It combines Swin-UNet
  segmentation with FiLM-based SWOT fusion, a two-stage context-verifier
  cascade, wind-visibility correction, KdV/eKdV amplitude inversion, and
  a curated database of 2315 verified internal wave events in the
  northern South China Sea (July-October 2023).
keywords:
  - ocean internal waves
  - synthetic aperture radar
  - Sentinel-1
  - SWOT
  - deep learning
  - semantic segmentation
  - KdV inversion
  - South China Sea
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
